    "details": "<div id=\"model-response-message-contentr_50826945147e0567\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-updated-hr-color force-compact-layout stronger tutor-markdown-rendering\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n<div id=\"model-response-message-contentr_4cab9340a9a8aa68\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color force-compact-layout stronger tutor-markdown-rendering\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1490 citation-end-1490\">Scratch to Hack</span></strong></div>\n<br />\n<div><em data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1489 citation-end-1489\">Organized by the Department of Computer Science and Engineering, Akal University, Talwandi Sabo</span></em></div>\n<br />\n<div><span class=\"citation-1488\">Get ready to </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"13\"><span class=\"citation-1488\">think, build, innovate, and hack!</span></strong> <strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"47\"><span class=\"citation-1488\">Scratch to Hack</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1488 citation-end-1488\"> is an inter-hackathon designed to bring together students and aspiring innovators to develop creati</span>ve, technology-driven solutions to real-world problem statements. Participants will have the opportunity to collaborate, build a working prototype, showcase their technical skills, and present their ideas before a panel of judges.</div>\n<br />\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Important Dates &amp; Timeline</h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">25 September 2026 (Friday) | 10:00 AM:</strong> Hackathon officially starts &amp; Tracks announced</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">28 September 2026 (Monday) | 10:00 AM:</strong> PPT Submission Deadline</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">28 September 2026 (Monday) | 5:00 PM &ndash; 6:00 PM:</strong> PPT Round Results announced (Qualified teams begin working on their projects)</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">29 &ndash; 30 September 2026:</strong> Hackathon Building Phase</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">30 September 2026 | 12:00 AM:</strong> Final Project Submission (Includes GitHub repository code &amp; demonstration video)</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1 October 2026 | 10:00 AM &ndash; 3:00 PM:</strong> Project Discussion &amp; Evaluation</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\">Event Details</h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Venue:</strong> Akal University Conference Room</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Opens:</strong> 19 September 2026</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Deadline:</strong> 26 September 2026</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Team Formation Deadline:</strong> 24 September <span class=\"citation-1484 citation-1485 citation-1486 citation-1487 citation-end-1487\">2026</span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"p-rc_3723c072067df46e-67\" data-path-to-node=\"9\"><span class=\"citation-1480 citation-1481 citation-1482 citation-1483 citation-end-1483\">Logistics &amp; Hospitality</span></h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1476 citation-1477 citation-1478 citation-1479\">Expenses:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1476 citation-1477 citation-1478 citation-1479 citation-end-1479\"> All travel and personal expenses must be covered by the participants on their own.</span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-1472 citation-1473 citation-1474 citation-1475\">Meals &amp; Refreshments:</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1472 citation-1473 citation-1474 citation-1475\"> Refreshments will be provided </span><em data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"62\"><span class=\"citation-1472 citation-1473 citation-1474 citation-1475\">only</span></em><span class=\"citation-1472 citation-1473 citation-1474 citation-1475 citation-end-1475\"> on the last day of the event.</span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"p-rc_3723c072067df46e-70\" data-path-to-node=\"11\"><span class=\"citation-1468 citation-1469 citation-1470 citation-1471 citation-end-1471\">E</span><span class=\"citation-1468 citation-1469 citation-1470 citation-end-1470\">ligibility &amp; Team Formation</span></h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\n<li>\n<div><span class=\"citation-1465 citation-1466 citation-1467\">Each team must consist of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"26\"><span class=\"citation-1465 citation-1466 citation-1467\">exactly 6 members</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1465 citation-1466 citation-1467 citation-end-1467\">.</span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span class=\"citation-1462 citation-1463 citation-1464 citation-end-1464\">All members of a tea</span><span class=\"citation-1462 citation-1463\">m must belong to the </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"41\"><span class=\"citation-1462 citation-1463\">same educational institution</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1462 citation-1463 citation-end-1463\">.</span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span class=\"citation-1460 citation-1461\">Each participant can be part of </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"32\"><span class=\"citation-1460 citation-1461 citation-end-1461\">only one t</span><span class=\"citation-1460\">eam</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1460 citation-end-1460\">.</span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span class=\"citation-1459 citation-end-1459\">Participants mus</span>t provide valid identification and institutional credentials when required.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Every team member must complete the required registration and verification process.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\">What You'll Do</h3>\n<div>Teams will work on official problem statements and challenge tracks announced for the Hackathon. Participants are expected to develop their solutions during the designated hacking period and should be able to explain their project'<span class=\"citation-1458\">s </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"233\"><span class=\"citation-1458\">architecture, functionality, implementation, and technology stack</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1458\">. Teams may use legitimate </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"325\"><span class=\"citation-1458\">open-source libraries, frameworks, APIs, datasets, development platforms, and AI tools</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1458 citation-end-1458\">, subject to their applicable licenses and terms of use. Signif</span>icant AI-assisted components must be disclosed, and participants must be capable of explaining the technical components of their solution.</div>\n<br />\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\">Evaluation Criteria</h3>\n<div>Projects will be evaluated on factors including:</div>\n<br />\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\n<li>\n<div>Innovation &amp; Creativity</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Technical Excellence</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Problem Relevance</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Impact &amp; Scalability</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>User Experience</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Functionality</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Presentation &amp; Demonstration</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div>Teams should be prepared to demonstrate their project and answer questions during the Project Discussion round. The decision of the appointed judging panel will be final.</div>\n<br />\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"19\">Submission Requirements</h3>\n<div>Teams will be required to submit:</div>\n<br />\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"21\">\n<li>\n<div>Presentation / Pitch Deck (by 28 Sept, 10:00 AM)</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Source Code (GitHub Repository link)(by 30 Sept,12:00 AM)</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Working Prototype &amp; Demonstration Video</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Project Description &amp; Technical Documentation</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Details of Technology Stack &amp; Third-party resources used</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"p-rc_3723c072067df46e-76\" data-path-to-node=\"22\"><span class=\"citation-1456 citation-1457 citation-end-1457\">Code of Conduct</span></h3>\n<div><span class=\"citation-1454 citation-1455\">All participants are expected to maintain a </span><strong data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"44\"><span class=\"citation-1454 citation-1455\">professional, respectful, collaborative, and safe environment</span></strong><span class=\"citation-1454 citation-1455 citation-end-1455\"> throughout the event. Harassment, discrimination, hate speech, threats, violence, deliberate disruption, theft, vandalism, unauthorized access, plagiarism, cheating, and other for</span><span class=\"citation-1454 citation-end-1454\">ms of miscon</span>duct are strictly prohibited. Unauthorized cybersecurity testing, attacks on other projects, or disruption of event infrastructure will lead to immediate disqualification and escalation to University authorities.</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
